1
00:00:04,838 --> 00:00:05,881
SHURI: (WHISPERING) Bast...

2
00:00:06,798 --> 00:00:08,717
time is running out.

3
00:00:09,885 --> 00:00:12,387
Please allow me to heal
my brother of this illness,

4
00:00:13,055 --> 00:00:15,599
and I will never
question your existence again.

5
00:00:16,642 --> 00:00:18,393
His heart rate is dropping
fast. Where are we?

6
00:00:18,477 --> 00:00:19,811
We are finishing
a sequence now.

7
00:00:19,895 --> 00:00:21,438
SHURI: GRIOT,
give me the controls.

8
00:00:21,605 --> 00:00:22,898
GRIOT: As you wish, Princess.

9
00:00:22,981 --> 00:00:24,983
(INDISTINCT CHATTER)

10
00:00:27,653 --> 00:00:28,737
(SYSTEM TRILLING)

11
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:30,072
What is the confidence rate?

12
00:00:30,656 --> 00:00:31,823
GRIOT: 25%.

13
00:00:32,491 --> 00:00:33,951
We'll have to try another way.

14
00:00:34,576 --> 00:00:35,786
GRIOT:
King T'Challa's heart rate

15
00:00:35,869 --> 00:00:38,080
has fallen to 31 beats
per minute.

16
00:00:38,163 --> 00:00:40,791
Princess,
you should go be by his side.

17
00:00:40,874 --> 00:00:43,293
I have to think.
Everyone, get out.

18
00:00:43,377 --> 00:00:44,628
(CHATTER CONTINUES)

19
00:00:44,711 --> 00:00:45,712
Get out!

20
00:00:49,967 --> 00:00:51,134
(PANTING)

21
00:00:51,927 --> 00:00:53,095
What is the confidence rate?

22
00:00:53,178 --> 00:00:54,596
GRIOT: 29.1%.

23
00:00:54,680 --> 00:00:55,722
Print it!

24
00:01:00,435 --> 00:01:02,563
GRIOT: Princess,
I am aware of the urgency,

25
00:01:02,646 --> 00:01:04,273
but I must warn you,

26
00:01:04,356 --> 00:01:06,233
this synthetic
Heart-Shaped Herb

27
00:01:06,316 --> 00:01:08,777
has a minimal chance of
producing the desired effects.

28
00:01:08,860 --> 00:01:11,863
I don't care! Has to work.

29
00:01:11,947 --> 00:01:14,157
(MACHINE WHIRRING)

30
00:01:20,247 --> 00:01:21,790
(MACHINE BEEPS)

31
00:01:23,834 --> 00:01:25,669
(FOOTSTEPS APPROACHING)

32
00:01:31,174 --> 00:01:32,175
GRIOT.

33
00:01:32,259 --> 00:01:33,302
GRIOT: Yes, Princess?

34
00:01:34,177 --> 00:01:35,721
What's my brother's
heart rate?

35
00:01:37,139 --> 00:01:38,307
(BREATHES SHAKILY)

36
00:01:40,767 --> 00:01:42,102
Your brother

37
00:01:43,186 --> 00:01:45,689
is with the ancestors.

38
00:01:49,860 --> 00:01:50,902
(GASPS SOFTLY)

39
00:01:52,696 --> 00:01:54,031
(CRYING) No.

40
00:01:58,076 --> 00:01:59,911
(SHAMAN SPEAKING XHOSA)

41
00:02:09,338 --> 00:02:10,922
(MOURNERS CHANT)

42
00:02:12,341 --> 00:02:13,842
(SHAMAN SPEAKING)

43
00:02:14,635 --> 00:02:15,636
(MOURNERS CHANT)

44
00:02:17,054 --> 00:02:18,263
(SHAMAN SPEAKING)

45
00:02:29,316 --> 00:02:30,400
ALL: Praise the ancestors.

46
00:02:30,484 --> 00:02:32,653
(MALE SINGER SINGING IN XHOSA)

47
00:02:50,087 --> 00:02:51,088
(UPBEAT MUSIC PLAYS)

48
00:02:51,171 --> 00:02:55,467
DANCERS: (SINGING)
T'Challa, T'Challa, T''Challa

49
00:02:55,550 --> 00:03:00,430
T'Challa, T'Challa, T''Challa

50
00:03:00,514 --> 00:03:04,768
T'Challa, T'Challa, T''Challa

51
00:03:05,936 --> 00:03:09,648
T'Challa, T'Challa, T''Challa

52
00:03:11,066 --> 00:03:13,944
T'Challa, T'Challa, T''Challa

53
00:03:14,027 --> 00:03:16,279
(FUNERAL BY BAABA MAAL PLAYING)

54
00:03:16,405 --> 00:03:20,158
T'Challa, T'Challa, T''Challa

55
00:03:21,660 --> 00:03:22,786
T'Challa

56
00:03:22,869 --> 00:03:24,871
(MUSIC AND SINGING TRANSITION
TO SLOW MOTION)

57
00:03:44,015 --> 00:03:46,059
(MALE SINGER LAMENT-SINGING)

58
00:03:49,771 --> 00:03:51,982
(SLOWED MUSIC CONTINUES)

59
00:04:04,119 --> 00:04:05,495
(MUSIC FADING)

60
00:04:09,791 --> 00:04:11,877
(ENGINE DRONING)

61
00:04:21,720 --> 00:04:23,930
(MELANCHOLY MUSIC PLAYING)

62
00:04:43,074 --> 00:04:44,701
(SOBBING)

63
00:04:50,207 --> 00:04:52,083
(IN ENGLISH) I'm sorry, I'm sorry.

64
00:05:09,935 --> 00:05:12,312
(CHORAL REQUIEM PLAYING)

65
00:05:45,679 --> 00:05:46,680
(REQUIEM ENDS)

66
00:05:47,556 --> 00:05:49,766
-(MELANCHOLY MUSIC PLAYS)
-(SNIFFLES)

67
00:05:51,601 --> 00:05:52,602
(MUSIC FADES)

68
00:05:54,980 --> 00:05:56,982
(WIND HOWLING SOFTLY)

69
00:06:27,762 --> 00:06:29,806
(AIRCRAFT ENGINE HUMMING)

70
00:06:35,437 --> 00:06:37,147
CHAIRPERSON: It is an honor for me...

71
00:06:37,230 --> 00:06:39,900
to invite her majesty,
Queen Ramonda,

72
00:06:39,983 --> 00:06:41,401
daughter of Lumumba,

73
00:06:41,484 --> 00:06:43,445
sovereign ruler
of the kingdom of Wakanda.

74
00:06:57,000 --> 00:06:58,627
US SECRETARY OF STATE:
Mr. Chairperson,

75
00:06:59,628 --> 00:07:04,215
I believe I speak for
all the member states here

76
00:07:04,299 --> 00:07:07,093
when I say that
I am deeply disappointed

77
00:07:07,177 --> 00:07:09,262
in Wakanda's failure

78
00:07:09,346 --> 00:07:13,808
to stand by promises to
participate in global efforts

79
00:07:13,892 --> 00:07:15,977
to tackle
international challenges,

80
00:07:16,061 --> 00:07:17,562
to share resources,

81
00:07:17,646 --> 00:07:19,856
and full cooperation

82
00:07:19,940 --> 00:07:21,399
concerning vibranium.

83
00:07:21,483 --> 00:07:22,901
(IN FRENCH)

84
00:07:39,167 --> 00:07:40,710
(IN ENGLISH)
I now give the floor

85
00:07:40,794 --> 00:07:42,712
to Her Majesty, Queen Ramonda.

86
00:07:49,886 --> 00:07:52,681
It has always been our policy

87
00:07:52,764 --> 00:07:57,769
to never trade vibranium
under any circumstance.

88
00:07:57,852 --> 00:08:02,148
Not because of the dangerous
potential of vibranium,

89
00:08:03,024 --> 00:08:07,821
but because of the dangerous
potential of you.

90
00:08:17,706 --> 00:08:18,790
(COMPUTER TRILLS)

91
00:08:19,708 --> 00:08:21,126
(IN FRENCH)

92
00:08:21,209 --> 00:08:23,586
(POWER SHUTS DOWN)

93
00:08:24,170 --> 00:08:25,630
(EXPLOSION)

94
00:08:25,755 --> 00:08:27,090
(MERC SPEAKING)

95
00:08:40,311 --> 00:08:41,312
(GASPS)

96
00:08:42,063 --> 00:08:43,481
(DOOR CHIMES)

97
00:08:43,565 --> 00:08:45,316
(DOOR HUMMING)

98
00:08:46,985 --> 00:08:48,153
(WOMAN GASPS)

99
00:08:48,236 --> 00:08:52,115
(IN ENGLISH)
You perform civility here.

100
00:08:53,116 --> 00:08:55,201
But we know what you whisper

101
00:08:55,827 --> 00:08:57,579
in your halls of leadership

102
00:08:57,662 --> 00:09:00,540
and in your
military facilities.

103
00:09:04,753 --> 00:09:07,672
"The King is dead.

104
00:09:09,466 --> 00:09:12,427
"The Black Panther is gone.

105
00:09:12,510 --> 00:09:14,304
(METAL CREAKING)

106
00:09:14,387 --> 00:09:17,599
"They have lost
their protector.

107
00:09:20,477 --> 00:09:22,520
(ROUSING MUSIC PLAYING)

108
00:09:23,521 --> 00:09:26,733
RAMONDA: "Now is our time...

109
00:09:28,234 --> 00:09:29,360
"to strike."

110
00:09:32,822 --> 00:09:33,948
(MERC SHOUTS IN FRENCH)

111
00:09:38,078 --> 00:09:39,829
(ALL GRUNTING)

112
00:09:40,663 --> 00:09:41,873
(GROANS)

113
00:09:45,251 --> 00:09:47,420
(GROANS)

114
00:09:47,504 --> 00:09:49,339
(TENSE MUSIC PLAYING)

115
00:09:49,422 --> 00:09:51,257
(MERCS GRUNTING AND GROANING)

116
00:09:56,554 --> 00:09:58,431
Aneka, where is your spear?

117
00:09:58,515 --> 00:10:00,016
Shuri gave me these to try.

118
00:10:00,683 --> 00:10:02,602
-(ANEKA GRUNTS LOUDLY)
-(GROANS)

119
00:10:02,685 --> 00:10:04,646
You know, I like them better.

120
00:10:04,729 --> 00:10:06,397
OKOYE: Our foremothers
gave us the spear...

121
00:10:06,481 --> 00:10:09,150
because it is precise,
elegant...

122
00:10:10,819 --> 00:10:11,861
and deadly.

123
00:10:13,738 --> 00:10:14,739
(SPEAR CLANGS)

124
00:10:14,823 --> 00:10:17,158
It will not change
under my watch.

125
00:10:19,077 --> 00:10:20,537
Yes, General.

126
00:10:21,204 --> 00:10:22,956
I told you not to bring them.

127
00:10:25,792 --> 00:10:27,961
Last night
there was another attack

128
00:10:28,044 --> 00:10:30,547
on one of
our outreach facilities.

129
00:10:31,464 --> 00:10:35,301
Proof of the involvement
of a member state

130
00:10:35,385 --> 00:10:39,389
is being uploaded to your
mobile devices as we speak.

131
00:10:39,472 --> 00:10:40,598
(CELL PHONES VIBRATING)

132
00:10:40,682 --> 00:10:43,393
And as for the identity
of the attackers...

133
00:10:45,562 --> 00:10:48,189
(ROUSING MUSIC PLAYING)

134
00:10:55,947 --> 00:10:57,073
(IN XHOSA)

135
00:11:01,119 --> 00:11:02,370
(IN FRENCH)

136
00:11:03,163 --> 00:11:06,624
(IN ENGLISH) Let our gracious
response to this incursion

137
00:11:07,625 --> 00:11:09,127
be an olive branch.

138
00:11:11,129 --> 00:11:14,090
Further attempts
on our resources

139
00:11:14,174 --> 00:11:17,468
will be considered
an act of aggression

140
00:11:17,552 --> 00:11:21,181
and met with
a much steeper response.

141
00:11:23,016 --> 00:11:25,351
We mourn the loss of our king.

142
00:11:26,352 --> 00:11:28,771
But do not think for a second

143
00:11:28,855 --> 00:11:31,149
that Wakanda
has lost her ability

144
00:11:31,232 --> 00:11:33,776
to protect our resources.

145
00:11:34,444 --> 00:11:38,072
We are aware
of the ongoing efforts by some

146
00:11:38,156 --> 00:11:41,326
to find vibranium
outside of Wakanda,

147
00:11:41,409 --> 00:11:45,663
and wish you the best of luck.

148
00:11:50,210 --> 00:11:52,545
PILOT: (ON RADIO)
This is Rotor 625

149
00:11:52,629 --> 00:11:53,922
requesting clearance to land.

150
00:11:58,009 --> 00:11:59,219
DR. GRAHAM: All right.
Meet you down there.

151
00:11:59,302 --> 00:12:00,303
Yeah.

152
00:12:02,847 --> 00:12:03,848
Hey!

153
00:12:04,724 --> 00:12:06,017
I thought you retired!

154
00:12:06,100 --> 00:12:07,227
I thought I had too.

155
00:12:07,310 --> 00:12:09,520
They said that machine
had a one in a billion chance

156
00:12:09,604 --> 00:12:10,772
of finding vibranium.

157
00:12:10,855 --> 00:12:11,940
Oh, less than that.

158
00:12:12,523 --> 00:12:14,525
(MACHINERY WHIRRING)

159
00:12:15,860 --> 00:12:18,404
(CREW SHOUTING INDISTINCTLY)

160
00:12:33,753 --> 00:12:34,921
Here we go.

161
00:12:35,713 --> 00:12:37,006
SALAZAR: (ON COMMS)
Cabin pressure is stable

162
00:12:37,090 --> 00:12:38,925
at negative one P-S-I.

163
00:12:44,472 --> 00:12:45,890
At 800 feet,

164
00:12:45,974 --> 00:12:48,017
passing through thermocline.

165
00:12:48,101 --> 00:12:49,727
All my life supports
in the green.

166
00:12:49,811 --> 00:12:51,771
(BEEPING)

167
00:12:51,854 --> 00:12:52,939
Copy you.

168
00:13:02,156 --> 00:13:03,658
SALAZAR: We've touched down.

169
00:13:11,207 --> 00:13:13,126
DR. GRAHAM:
Perfect. So, Salazar,

170
00:13:13,209 --> 00:13:14,836
you are near the site
right there.

171
00:13:16,087 --> 00:13:18,214
SALAZAR: Yeah,
it's astonishing.

172
00:13:20,216 --> 00:13:21,551
The drill
seemed to make contact

173
00:13:21,634 --> 00:13:23,011
with a metallic substance.

174
00:13:24,012 --> 00:13:26,306
JACKSON: Whatever it is,
It's solid.

175
00:13:26,389 --> 00:13:28,683
I've never seen a drill bit
chewed up like this before.

176
00:13:32,103 --> 00:13:33,313
SMITTY: I'll be.

177
00:13:33,980 --> 00:13:35,523
Vibranium in the ocean.

178
00:13:35,606 --> 00:13:37,567
Let's go ahead and get
the detector out of there,

179
00:13:37,650 --> 00:13:39,402
since it's the only one
we've got.

180
00:13:40,153 --> 00:13:42,864
SALAZAR: Heading towards
the vibranium detector.

181
00:13:47,452 --> 00:13:49,579
(POWER SHUTTING DOWN)

182
00:13:54,292 --> 00:13:55,960
Okay, Salazar,
we just went dark.

183
00:13:56,044 --> 00:13:58,254
SALAZAR: Yeah.
The rig lost power.

184
00:13:58,338 --> 00:14:00,048
Copy that.
I'm gonna fix it up here.

185
00:14:00,757 --> 00:14:03,259
(EERIE VOCAL CALL IN DISTANCE)

186
00:14:16,439 --> 00:14:17,648
JACKSON: What the hell was that?

187
00:14:22,528 --> 00:14:24,405
(VOICE VOCALIZING
IN EERIE TONE)

188
00:14:31,079 --> 00:14:32,288
SALAZAR: Jackson,

189
00:14:32,372 --> 00:14:34,207
tell me you're seeing this?

190
00:14:34,290 --> 00:14:36,459
DR. GRAHAM: Hang on.
Salazar's heart rate.

191
00:14:36,542 --> 00:14:38,669
Hey, uh, Salazar,
can you give me a visual?

192
00:14:40,588 --> 00:14:42,799
SALAZAR:
It's a phantom jellyfish.

193
00:14:42,882 --> 00:14:44,509
I've never seen one
this color.

194
00:14:45,176 --> 00:14:46,594
Emergency dive team, stand by.

195
00:14:46,677 --> 00:14:49,764
Salazar, uh,
we just lost Jackson's vitals.

196
00:14:49,847 --> 00:14:50,973
Can you see him?

197
00:14:51,057 --> 00:14:53,267
(AIR HISSING)

198
00:14:58,689 --> 00:15:00,608
No. He's gone. (SHUDDERS)

199
00:15:00,691 --> 00:15:02,693
Can you clarify? What do
you mean by, "He's gone"?

200
00:15:02,777 --> 00:15:04,362
(BREATHING SHAKILY)

201
00:15:04,445 --> 00:15:05,947
Salazar, do you copy?

202
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,073
(SALAZAR GASPING
AND WHIMPERING)

203
00:15:07,156 --> 00:15:08,825
-Salazar?
-(SCREAMS)

204
00:15:08,908 --> 00:15:09,909
(SCREAMING STOPS)

205
00:15:11,953 --> 00:15:14,247
MAN: (ON RADIO) Smitty,
we got a situation out here.

206
00:15:17,208 --> 00:15:19,335
(VOICES HARMONIZING EERILY)

207
00:15:26,217 --> 00:15:27,260
What's that sound?

208
00:15:27,343 --> 00:15:29,387
West, you got a visual
on what's making that sound?

209
00:15:35,977 --> 00:15:37,395
West, how copy, over?

210
00:15:40,773 --> 00:15:42,150
(ON RADIO)
West, you got a visual?

211
00:15:42,233 --> 00:15:44,235
(VOICES HARMONIZING
MELODIOUSLY)

212
00:16:01,210 --> 00:16:02,670
SMITTY: It's some kind
of sonic attack.

213
00:16:02,753 --> 00:16:04,422
Hey, Smitty, earplugs.

214
00:16:04,505 --> 00:16:05,923
(HIGH-PITCHED PINGING)

215
00:16:07,758 --> 00:16:10,303
(MELODIOUS HARMONIZING
CONTINUES)

216
00:16:10,386 --> 00:16:11,387
(RADIO BEEPS)

217
00:16:11,471 --> 00:16:12,763
We are under attack.

218
00:16:12,847 --> 00:16:14,724
You need to send in
a strike team immediately.

219
00:16:14,807 --> 00:16:17,935
Copy. Mayday, mayday,
this is Rotor 625.

220
00:16:18,019 --> 00:16:19,395
We are requesting
assistance immediately.

221
00:16:19,479 --> 00:16:20,771
It's the Wakandans.

222
00:16:20,855 --> 00:16:22,773
(BREATHING SHAKILY)

223
00:16:22,857 --> 00:16:23,983
It has to be.

224
00:16:25,151 --> 00:16:27,403
(VOICES CHANTING HARMONIOUSLY)

225
00:16:40,249 --> 00:16:41,626
Henderson.

226
00:16:41,709 --> 00:16:43,044
Smitty, we gotta go.

227
00:16:43,127 --> 00:16:44,128
Henderson!

228
00:16:45,213 --> 00:16:46,672
Let's go.

229
00:16:47,548 --> 00:16:48,799
(VOCALIZING STOPS)

230
00:16:48,883 --> 00:16:49,884
What's going on?

231
00:16:50,551 --> 00:16:51,677
Get off the edge.

232
00:16:51,761 --> 00:16:54,555
-(GRUNTS)
-(SINISTER MUSIC PLAYS)

233
00:16:56,182 --> 00:16:57,558
(GROANS)

234
00:16:57,642 --> 00:16:59,227
(CRYPTIC MUSIC PLAYING)

235
00:16:59,310 --> 00:17:00,645
(GASPS)

236
00:17:04,857 --> 00:17:05,858
(YELLING)

237
00:17:08,236 --> 00:17:09,362
(INOTHER LANGUAGE)

238
00:17:09,487 --> 00:17:10,947
(PANTING)

239
00:17:11,030 --> 00:17:12,698
(SINISTER MUSIC PLAYING)

240
00:17:22,333 --> 00:17:23,960
(WARRIORS GRUNTING)

241
00:17:28,631 --> 00:17:29,674
(YELLS)

242
00:17:29,757 --> 00:17:31,384
(IN ENGLISH) Go, go, go, go!

243
00:17:31,467 --> 00:17:33,052
(WARRIOR GRUNTS)

244
00:17:33,135 --> 00:17:34,887
(WARRIOR GROANING)

245
00:17:38,558 --> 00:17:39,600
Now! Go!

246
00:17:39,684 --> 00:17:41,727
Spin! Spin them off!

247
00:17:42,603 --> 00:17:44,230
Okay. They're gone!

248
00:17:44,313 --> 00:17:46,440
-Oh, my God!
-(PILOT SIGHS)

249
00:17:46,524 --> 00:17:49,360
(CRYPTIC MUSIC PLAYING)

250
00:18:04,959 --> 00:18:06,085
DR. GRAHAM: Just get us out.

251
00:18:06,168 --> 00:18:07,628
PILOT: We're good.

252
00:18:07,712 --> 00:18:09,046
-We're good.
-(LINE RINGING)

253
00:18:09,130 --> 00:18:10,256
Where is the strike team?

254
00:18:10,506 --> 00:18:12,633
It wasn't the Wakandans.
They... They were blue.

255
00:18:12,717 --> 00:18:13,801
Everyone is dead...

256
00:18:13,884 --> 00:18:15,970
-(BOTH YELP)
-(ALARM BLARING)

257
00:18:16,053 --> 00:18:17,430
Shit. What is going on?

258
00:18:17,513 --> 00:18:19,348
PILOT: We're getting
pulled backwards.

259
00:18:20,474 --> 00:18:21,934
Oh, my God.

260
00:18:23,978 --> 00:18:25,521
(BOTH SCREAM)

261
00:18:26,564 --> 00:18:28,858
-(SCREAMING)
-Oh, God! Hang on!

262
00:18:48,336 --> 00:18:50,796
(WAKANDA BY BAABA MAAL
PLAYING)

263
00:19:03,726 --> 00:19:05,728
ANDERSON COOPER: Queen Ramonda
of the nation of Wakanda

264
00:19:05,811 --> 00:19:07,938
gave an electrifying speech
at the UN yesterday,

265
00:19:08,022 --> 00:19:09,482
while members of her military

266
00:19:09,565 --> 00:19:11,233
escorted
captive mercenaries

267
00:19:11,317 --> 00:19:12,777
onto the floor of the UN.

268
00:19:12,860 --> 00:19:14,695
A year has passed
since Queen Ramonda

269
00:19:14,779 --> 00:19:16,822
was reinstated
as ruler of Wakanda

270
00:19:16,906 --> 00:19:18,407
after King T'Challa's
sudden death

271
00:19:18,491 --> 00:19:20,451
from an undisclosed illness
last year.

272
00:19:20,534 --> 00:19:22,787
All eyes are on the tiny,
powerful nation,

273
00:19:22,870 --> 00:19:25,456
as it finds itself
increasingly isolated...

274
00:19:25,539 --> 00:19:26,999
(OKOYE SPEAKING XHOSA)

275
00:19:27,875 --> 00:19:29,710
(IN ENGLISH)
Approaching the river border.

276
00:19:30,878 --> 00:19:32,922
(WAKANDA BY BAABA MAAL
CONTINUES)

277
00:19:36,300 --> 00:19:37,718
We are home.

278
00:19:41,764 --> 00:19:42,765
(WHIRRING)

279
00:19:45,810 --> 00:19:48,187
(SPLASHING RHYTHMICALLY)

280
00:19:49,522 --> 00:19:51,440
(MAN YELLS WAR CRY)

281
00:19:53,651 --> 00:19:55,569
(DRAMATIC PERCUSSION MUSIC
PLAYING)

282
00:20:27,810 --> 00:20:28,978
GRIOT: Princess.

283
00:20:29,061 --> 00:20:30,104
Just a moment.

284
00:20:30,187 --> 00:20:31,522
I'm in the middle
of something.

285
00:20:31,605 --> 00:20:33,232
GRIOT: / understand,
Princess, however...

286
00:20:33,315 --> 00:20:35,025
You're disrupting
my train of thought.

287
00:20:38,446 --> 00:20:39,447
RAMONDA: Shuri.

288
00:20:39,989 --> 00:20:40,990
Mother.

289
00:20:41,073 --> 00:20:42,158
GRIOT: / was trying
to tell you.

290
00:20:42,241 --> 00:20:44,243
The Queen is here.

291
00:20:44,326 --> 00:20:46,454
-Thank you.
-That thing unnerves me.

292
00:20:46,537 --> 00:20:47,788
I think that one day

293
00:20:47,872 --> 00:20:50,166
artificial intelligence
is going to kill us all.

294
00:20:50,249 --> 00:20:53,085
My Al isn't like the movies,
Mother.

295
00:20:53,169 --> 00:20:54,879
It does exactly
what I tell it to do.

296
00:20:54,962 --> 00:20:57,548
Yeah, if only children
were the same.

297
00:20:58,758 --> 00:21:01,469
Everyone seems to be
working diligently.

298
00:21:02,136 --> 00:21:05,681
Yes. Rapid emergency
response task.

299
00:21:06,348 --> 00:21:07,475
There could be any number of

300
00:21:07,558 --> 00:21:09,226
unknown threats
on the horizon,

301
00:21:09,310 --> 00:21:10,978
and they're
creating solutions.

302
00:21:11,979 --> 00:21:14,023
RAMONDA: Oh, what is this?

303
00:21:14,106 --> 00:21:15,816
Exo Suits for our army.

304
00:21:15,900 --> 00:21:18,402
It grants the user
super-human strength,

305
00:21:18,486 --> 00:21:20,654
speed, and durability.

306
00:21:20,738 --> 00:21:23,157
But, as always,
Okoye had notes.

307
00:21:23,240 --> 00:21:24,492
What were her notes?

308
00:21:24,575 --> 00:21:25,951
She hates them.

309
00:21:26,035 --> 00:21:27,036
Oh.

310
00:21:31,373 --> 00:21:33,667
What about recreating
the Heart-Shaped Herb?

311
00:21:33,751 --> 00:21:35,961
Have you made
any progress on that?

312
00:21:36,045 --> 00:21:37,254
GRIOT: Excuse me, Princess.

313
00:21:37,338 --> 00:21:40,549
Nakia, daughter of Yaa,
is trying to reach you again.

314
00:21:40,633 --> 00:21:41,634
Maybe you should...

315
00:21:41,717 --> 00:21:43,469
Maybe you should
continue your calculations

316
00:21:43,552 --> 00:21:44,720
as I instructed.

317
00:21:44,804 --> 00:21:46,305
GRIOT: As you wish, Princess.

318
00:21:47,807 --> 00:21:49,350
We do not need the Herb,
Mother.

319
00:21:50,810 --> 00:21:52,394
We need new technology.

320
00:21:52,478 --> 00:21:53,729
What of the Black Panther?

321
00:21:56,941 --> 00:22:00,611
The mantle has unified
our nation for centuries.

322
00:22:00,694 --> 00:22:02,863
The Black Panther
is a relic, Mother.

323
00:22:02,947 --> 00:22:05,449
I wasn't trying to save
the mantle with the Herb,

324
00:22:05,533 --> 00:22:07,701
I was trying
to save my brother.

325
00:22:10,162 --> 00:22:11,163
RAMONDA: Oh, Shuri.

326
00:22:12,039 --> 00:22:13,040
(SIGHS)

327
00:22:19,129 --> 00:22:20,339
(SIGHS)

328
00:22:24,885 --> 00:22:26,679
Do you know what day it is?

329
00:22:26,762 --> 00:22:27,763
Tuesday.

330
00:22:29,056 --> 00:22:30,558
The date, child.

331
00:22:32,685 --> 00:22:33,686
(SHURI SIGHS)

332
00:22:36,814 --> 00:22:38,065
Brother's passing.

333
00:22:38,732 --> 00:22:40,025
One year ago today.

334
00:22:50,160 --> 00:22:51,245
Have you planned anything?

335
00:22:51,328 --> 00:22:55,249
Yes. It involves you taking
your mother for a drive.

336
00:22:55,833 --> 00:22:57,251
-Right now?
-Right now.

337
00:22:57,918 --> 00:22:59,545
And you can leave
your Kimoyo Beads here.

338
00:22:59,628 --> 00:23:00,754
-Mother.
-No, no.

339
00:23:00,838 --> 00:23:02,673
You won't need them
where we are going.

340
00:23:04,383 --> 00:23:05,426
Hmm?

341
00:23:07,428 --> 00:23:10,389
And the other two. Yes.

342
00:23:11,265 --> 00:23:12,266
(SHURI SCOFFS)

343
00:23:22,234 --> 00:23:24,028
(DISTANT ANIMAL CALLS)

344
00:23:27,489 --> 00:23:28,782
(SIGHS)

345
00:23:31,493 --> 00:23:33,245
(INSECTS CHIRPING)

346
00:23:34,163 --> 00:23:38,000
You need to sit here with me.
And with yourself.

347
00:23:38,083 --> 00:23:40,669
It is the only way
you are going to heal

348
00:23:40,753 --> 00:23:43,088
from the wound caused
by T'Challa's death.

349
00:23:43,172 --> 00:23:44,465
I'm fine, Mother.

350
00:23:45,883 --> 00:23:47,843
You don't have to worry
about me.

351
00:23:49,094 --> 00:23:52,723
He's gone,
but I'm moving forward.

352
00:23:52,806 --> 00:23:54,642
T'Challa is dead,

353
00:23:54,725 --> 00:23:57,603
but that doesn't mean
he is gone.

354
00:23:58,103 --> 00:24:00,981
When that illness
took your brother from us,

355
00:24:01,148 --> 00:24:05,653
I had to lead a wounded nation
and a broken world.

356
00:24:05,819 --> 00:24:08,530
But I still took time
in the bush.

357
00:24:08,697 --> 00:24:11,951
I wandered
until I found water.

358
00:24:12,117 --> 00:24:13,494
And I sat.

359
00:24:15,120 --> 00:24:16,789
Then I did this ritual

360
00:24:16,956 --> 00:24:19,333
that I am about
to show you now.

361
00:24:19,416 --> 00:24:21,835
(SPIRITUAL MUSIC PLAYING)

362
00:24:21,919 --> 00:24:26,131
I found your brother
in the breeze,

363
00:24:27,424 --> 00:24:30,803
pushing me gently, but firm.

364
00:24:31,804 --> 00:24:33,973
Like his hand on my shoulder.

365
00:24:36,475 --> 00:24:37,810
It took some time,

366
00:24:39,186 --> 00:24:41,146
but he was there.

367
00:24:47,361 --> 00:24:48,779
He wasn't there, Mother.

368
00:24:50,572 --> 00:24:52,032
The presence that you felt

369
00:24:52,116 --> 00:24:54,034
was just a construct
of your mind.

370
00:24:54,118 --> 00:24:56,161
(SPIRITUAL MUSIC CONTINUES)

371
00:24:56,245 --> 00:24:59,999
Brought on so you could feel
some comfort or joy.

372
00:25:00,541 --> 00:25:02,126
That's all.

373
00:25:03,711 --> 00:25:04,878
Hmm.

374
00:25:09,008 --> 00:25:11,885
What construct
does your mind create

375
00:25:12,052 --> 00:25:14,013
when you think
of your brother?

376
00:25:14,972 --> 00:25:16,932
Does it offer you comfort?

377
00:25:18,308 --> 00:25:19,685
Or torment?

378
00:25:21,353 --> 00:25:23,480
(SPIRITUAL MUSIC CONTINUES)

379
00:25:29,820 --> 00:25:30,821
(SIGHS)

380
00:25:33,365 --> 00:25:34,450
Come, child.

381
00:25:46,211 --> 00:25:47,212
How did you get this?

382
00:25:47,379 --> 00:25:48,505
What does it matter?

383
00:25:49,339 --> 00:25:51,133
What does this have to do
with your ritual?

384
00:25:52,301 --> 00:25:54,636
RAMONDA: Burning
of the funeral garments

385
00:25:54,803 --> 00:25:57,056
marks the end
of the mourning period

386
00:25:57,222 --> 00:26:00,142
and the beginning
of a new relationship

387
00:26:00,225 --> 00:26:02,478
with our loved ones
that have passed on...

388
00:26:02,978 --> 00:26:04,563
I'm not doing this, Mother.

389
00:26:05,898 --> 00:26:07,274
If I sit

390
00:26:07,441 --> 00:26:09,985
and think about my brother
for too long,

391
00:26:11,487 --> 00:26:14,281
it won't be these clothes
I'll burn.

392
00:26:15,532 --> 00:26:17,076
It will be the world...

393
00:26:18,494 --> 00:26:20,037
and everyone in it.

394
00:26:20,370 --> 00:26:22,372
(SIGHS) Shuri...

395
00:26:26,835 --> 00:26:29,755
Shuri, there's something
that I need to tell you

396
00:26:30,339 --> 00:26:31,548
about your brother.

397
00:26:31,632 --> 00:26:34,093
(ELEPHANTS TRUMPETING)

398
00:26:36,095 --> 00:26:37,096
Mother, wait!

399
00:26:37,679 --> 00:26:39,640
-What are you doing?
-(FOOTSTEPS RUMBLING)

400
00:26:39,723 --> 00:26:41,100
(RAMONDA PANTING)

401
00:26:41,183 --> 00:26:42,226
(RUMBLING FADES)

402
00:26:46,522 --> 00:26:48,524
(UNEASY MUSIC PLAYING)

403
00:26:52,111 --> 00:26:54,321
(SUSPENSEFUL MUSIC PLAYING)

404
00:27:04,414 --> 00:27:06,333
This better not be
a part of your ritual.

405
00:27:06,416 --> 00:27:07,751
It isn't.

406
00:27:09,378 --> 00:27:11,046
RAMONDA: Stop! Right there!

407
00:27:11,713 --> 00:27:14,550
Who are you?
And how did you get in here?

408
00:27:16,093 --> 00:27:17,594
This place is amazing.

409
00:27:18,512 --> 00:27:20,597
The air is pristine.

410
00:27:22,057 --> 00:27:23,058
And the water...

411
00:27:24,601 --> 00:27:26,728
My mother told stories
about a place like this.

412
00:27:27,062 --> 00:27:30,232
A protected land with people
that never have to leave.

413
00:27:30,399 --> 00:27:32,734
That never have to change
who they were.

414
00:27:34,319 --> 00:27:35,404
What reason do you have

415
00:27:35,487 --> 00:27:37,281
to reveal your secret
to the world?

416
00:27:37,364 --> 00:27:40,325
lam not a woman
who enjoys repeating herself.

417
00:27:40,492 --> 00:27:42,369
Who are you?

418
00:27:42,536 --> 00:27:43,745
MAN: I have many names.

419
00:27:44,371 --> 00:27:47,457
My people call me
K'uk'ulkan...

420
00:27:50,377 --> 00:27:52,087
but my enemies call me Namor.

421
00:27:53,881 --> 00:27:56,425
The American military
detected vibranium

422
00:27:56,508 --> 00:27:58,093
under my nation's domain.

423
00:27:59,094 --> 00:28:02,639
I was able to
stop them from minin' it,

424
00:28:03,557 --> 00:28:04,850
but we need Wakanda's help

425
00:28:04,933 --> 00:28:06,685
to prevent it
from happenin' again.

426
00:28:07,811 --> 00:28:10,772
They use a machine designed
by an American scientist.

427
00:28:10,939 --> 00:28:13,442
Vibranium only exists here.

428
00:28:13,609 --> 00:28:14,943
In Wakanda.

429
00:28:15,110 --> 00:28:16,486
Mother, he's covered in it.

430
00:28:20,365 --> 00:28:24,119
Your son exposed the power
of vibranium to the world.

431
00:28:24,661 --> 00:28:26,997
In response,
other nations have begun

432
00:28:27,080 --> 00:28:28,498
searching the planet for it.

433
00:28:28,665 --> 00:28:32,085
His choice has compromised us.

434
00:28:32,878 --> 00:28:35,255
I think Wakanda
could find the scientist

435
00:28:35,339 --> 00:28:36,632
and bring them to me?

436
00:28:37,382 --> 00:28:41,386
It is only fair that Wakanda
helps to resolve our dilemma.

437
00:28:41,553 --> 00:28:44,014
You do not sneak
into my country

438
00:28:44,097 --> 00:28:46,808
and tell me what is fair.

439
00:28:48,268 --> 00:28:51,355
I have more soldiers than
this land has blades of grass.

440
00:28:52,147 --> 00:28:54,858
And they have
incomparable strength.

441
00:28:55,359 --> 00:28:58,487
I would hate to come back
under different circumstances.

442
00:29:00,948 --> 00:29:01,949
(INHALES SHARPLY)

443
00:29:04,493 --> 00:29:06,954
When you have the scientist,
blow into this,

444
00:29:07,120 --> 00:29:08,455
place it in the ocean.

445
00:29:08,914 --> 00:29:10,916
I'll be there
shortly afterwards.

446
00:29:14,461 --> 00:29:15,671
For your own sake,

447
00:29:16,171 --> 00:29:18,090
don't mention
anything about me

448
00:29:18,173 --> 00:29:19,967
to anyone outside of Wakanda.

449
00:29:28,684 --> 00:29:30,602
Did you see the wings
on his ankles?

450
00:29:31,353 --> 00:29:33,355
(RAMONDA BREATHING SHAKILY)

451
00:29:45,367 --> 00:29:46,910
(OMINOUS MUSIC PLAYING)

452
00:29:46,994 --> 00:29:48,203
SHURI: How did he do that?

453
00:29:48,954 --> 00:29:50,580
RAMONDA:
We must convene the Council.

454
00:29:52,666 --> 00:29:54,209
OKOYE: Heaven Scrapers
had no evidence

455
00:29:54,293 --> 00:29:56,003
of any activity at all.

456
00:29:58,088 --> 00:30:02,926
Oh, the river border
has been breached, huh?

457
00:30:03,010 --> 00:30:04,469
If my soldiers were present,

458
00:30:04,886 --> 00:30:07,097
this "fish man"

459
00:30:07,264 --> 00:30:09,099
would be bound before us
as we speak.

460
00:30:09,182 --> 00:30:11,435
If your muscle brains
were present,

461
00:30:11,601 --> 00:30:12,894
they would still be there

462
00:30:12,978 --> 00:30:14,771
choking on their
fuzzy adornments.

463
00:30:14,855 --> 00:30:16,106
You bald-headed demon...

464
00:30:16,189 --> 00:30:18,066
Show some respect, you two.

465
00:30:18,150 --> 00:30:19,234
M'BAKU: Respect?

466
00:30:19,318 --> 00:30:21,820
These men should be
ashamed to show their faces!

467
00:30:21,903 --> 00:30:22,988
Watch your tone, Jabari!

468
00:30:23,071 --> 00:30:25,157
(JABARIS HOOTING)

469
00:30:26,992 --> 00:30:27,993
(YELLS)

470
00:30:28,076 --> 00:30:29,578
(SPEARS THUD)

471
00:30:36,418 --> 00:30:37,961
OKOYE: As I was saying,

472
00:30:38,128 --> 00:30:40,922
there was no aerial
surveillance footage of him.

473
00:30:41,006 --> 00:30:42,341
And nothing
on the radar as well.

474
00:30:42,507 --> 00:30:45,969
So, he swam underwater
for 100 kilometers.

475
00:30:46,136 --> 00:30:47,637
RAMONDA: He was not alone.

476
00:30:47,721 --> 00:30:50,015
And claims to command
a massive army.

477
00:30:50,098 --> 00:30:54,394
He wants us to deliver
one American scientist?

478
00:30:54,478 --> 00:30:55,520
So he can kill them?

479
00:30:55,604 --> 00:30:56,688
Do it.

480
00:30:58,982 --> 00:31:00,776
We never had to face an enemy

481
00:31:00,859 --> 00:31:02,611
with access
to vibranium before.

482
00:31:03,570 --> 00:31:05,572
And we have no Black Panther
to protect us.

483
00:31:05,655 --> 00:31:07,282
M'BAKU: That is because
this wise Council

484
00:31:07,366 --> 00:31:09,951
allowed Killmonger
to take the throne

485
00:31:10,118 --> 00:31:12,079
and burn up all of your
precious Heart-Shaped Herb.

486
00:31:12,162 --> 00:31:14,664
M'Baku,
what would you have us do?

487
00:31:14,831 --> 00:31:17,209
We should find the fish man
and kill him.

488
00:31:18,001 --> 00:31:21,963
If we do
what he is asking for now,

489
00:31:22,130 --> 00:31:24,549
what is to stop him
from coming back

490
00:31:24,633 --> 00:31:26,426
and asking for more?

491
00:31:28,428 --> 00:31:29,429
(SIGHS)

492
00:31:30,389 --> 00:31:32,766
(BELIEVE BY BUSISWA ET AL
PLAYING ON SPEAKERS)

493
00:31:35,852 --> 00:31:36,895
RAMONDA: As you were.

494
00:31:38,605 --> 00:31:42,734
Is it just me, or does this
keep getting uglier?

495
00:31:43,068 --> 00:31:44,069
It's you.

496
00:31:44,861 --> 00:31:46,780
-So, does it work?
-Yes.

497
00:31:46,947 --> 00:31:48,365
This thing can detect

498
00:31:48,448 --> 00:31:50,659
the altered frequency
of vibranium

499
00:31:50,826 --> 00:31:53,954
through water, stones,
even heavy metals.

500
00:31:54,037 --> 00:31:55,831
Whoever built this
is brilliant.

501
00:31:56,164 --> 00:31:57,582
Come, look.

502
00:31:58,166 --> 00:32:00,836
Some are custom parts
and others look like

503
00:32:01,002 --> 00:32:02,754
they gathered it
from a junkyard.

504
00:32:02,921 --> 00:32:05,173
I am still struggling
to believe

505
00:32:05,257 --> 00:32:08,218
that vibranium exists
outside of Wakanda.

506
00:32:08,385 --> 00:32:10,637
Perhaps there was
more than one meteorite.

507
00:32:10,804 --> 00:32:12,514
Our planet is covered
of mostly water,

508
00:32:12,597 --> 00:32:13,682
so it's reasonable

509
00:32:13,765 --> 00:32:15,809
that the other one
just landed there.

510
00:32:15,976 --> 00:32:18,061
This changes everything
that we know.

511
00:32:18,228 --> 00:32:21,690
The Great Mound.
All of the legends and fables.

512
00:32:22,399 --> 00:32:24,276
Those stories
are seared in my mind.

513
00:32:24,443 --> 00:32:26,236
That sounds very painful.

514
00:32:28,530 --> 00:32:30,532
So we have to find
this scientist after all.

515
00:32:32,159 --> 00:32:33,869
-I do have an idea.
-RAMONDA: Mm.

516
00:32:34,661 --> 00:32:35,996
I'm going to need
the princess.

517
00:32:36,163 --> 00:32:38,165
Out of the question.

518
00:32:38,248 --> 00:32:40,459
She is in no state
to be in the field.

519
00:32:40,542 --> 00:32:41,877
(IN XHOSA)

520
00:32:42,836 --> 00:32:45,380
